<title>USA: U.S. meat output 2.9 pct below week ago-USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. meat output 2.9 pct below week ago-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red meat production for week ending Saturday, Feb 15, fell 2.9 pct at 796.5 million lbs.-USDA</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING/1  BEEF   CALF/VEAL   PORK/2 LAMB/MUTTON TOTALS/3</p>
<p>15-Feb-97	461.5     6.9	 322.8	5.3	796.5</p>
<p>08-Feb-97	484.1     6.8	 324.1	4.9	819.9</p>
<p>Change:	   -4.7%    1.5%	 -0.4%     8.2%     -2.9%</p>
<p>17-Feb-96	494.9     7.0	 332.9	5.5	840.3</p>
<p>Change:	   -6.7%   -1.4%	 -3.0%    -3.6%     -5.2%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:     3148.6    43.6	2093.9     29.3     5315.4</p>
<p>1996 YTD:     3306.0    46.1	2315.7     35.4     5703.2</p>
<p>Change:	   -4.8%   -5.4%	 -9.6%   -17.2%     -6.8%</p>
<p>LIVESTOCK SLAUGHTER (HEAD)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING   CATTLE   CALVES/VEALERS     HOGS     SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>15-Feb-97     670,000	   33,000     1,705,000	80,000</p>
<p>08-Feb-97     703,000	   33,000     1,711,000	75,000</p>
<p>Change:	  -4.7%	     0.0%	   -0.4%	  6.7%</p>
<p>17-Feb-96     705,000	   34,000     1,794,000	86,000</p>
<p>Change:	  -5.0%	    -2.9%	   -5.0%	 -7.0%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:   4,590,000	  210,000    11,079,000     448,000</p>
<p>1996 YTD:*  4,669,000	  220,000    12,429,000     549,000</p>
<p>Change:	  -1.7%	    -4.5%	  -10.9%	-18.4%</p>
<p>*1996 slaughter totals adjusted to reflect NASS revisions  </p>
<p>AVERAGE WEIGHTS (LBS.)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING  LIVE CATTLE   CALVES/VEALERS   HOGS  SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>15-Feb-97    Est    1163	  343	   258	  132</p>
<p>08-Feb-97    Est    1164	  338	   258	  132</p>
<p>17-Feb-96    Actual 1177	  360	   256	  129</p>
<p>Dressed</p>
<p>15-Feb-97    Est     692	  212	   190	   66</p>
<p>08-Feb-97    Est     692	  209	   190	   66</p>
<p>17-Feb-96    Actual  706	  211	   186	   64</p>
<p>FOR THE WEEK PERCENTAGE OF TOTAL CATTLE SLAUGHTERED BY CLASS</p>
<p>ENDING	 STEERS	HEIFERS     COWS     BULLS &amp; STAGS</p>
<p>01-Feb-97    46.5%	  32.4%	19.4%	  1.6%</p>
<p>03-Feb-96    49.8%	  30.3%	18.3%	  1.6%</p>
<p>THE WEEK PERCENTAGE OF TOTAL HOGS SLAUGHTERED BY CLASS</p>
<p>ENDING	BARROWS &amp; GILTS	    SOWS     STAGS &amp; BOARS</p>
<p>01-Feb-97    96.1%			 3.2%	   0.6%</p>
<p>03-Feb-96    95.6%			 3.7%	   0.7%</p>
<p>*1996 slaughter totals adjusted to reflect NASS revisions.</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 YTD reflects six production days.</p>
<p>1997 YTD reflects four production days</p>
